# SoilGood Project Context

This is **SoilGood**, a Flutter IoT + AI mobile app for Philippine farmers.

## Core purpose
Help farmers make informed irrigation, nutrient, and crop decisions using real-time soil data, weather, AI recommendations, and historical analytics.

## Hardware
ESP32 + 8-in-1 soil sensors: moisture, pH, temperature, EC, salinity, NPK. Persist ~every **15 minutes**.

## Stack (locked)
- Flutter app + **Supabase** (Free) + prefer **free** APIs
- UI theme: `docs/context/UI_THEME.md` (primary `#4A7C59`, matte white, Literata + Nunito Sans)

## Features to implement
1. Real-time soil monitoring dashboard
2. Weather API (current + forecast)
3. Historical monitoring records
4. AI recommendations (soil assessment, irrigation, management actions, crop suitability)
5. Analytics from history (trends, irrigation patterns, nutrient depletion, soil health score, weather–soil correlation, seasonal crop suitability, simple predictions)

## Important conventions
- App name is **SoilGood**
- Always check `docs/context/` and `docs/pages/` before building
- Persist timestamped sensor + weather data early — required for analytics
- App shell: persistent nav; content area only swaps/loads
- Prefer practical farmer-facing UX over complex dashboards
